Upgrade procedure for tzcode

Source:	https://data.iana.org/time-zones/releases/tzcodeVERSION.tar.gz
	https://data.iana.org/time-zones/releases/tzcodeVERSION.tar.gz.asc
Key:	Paul Eggert <eggert@cs.ucla.edu>
	7E37 92A9 D8AC F7D6 33BC  1588 ED97 E90E 62AA 7E34

Vendor branch:	vendor/tzcode/dist
Vendor tag:	vendor/tzcode/dist/VERSION (e.g. vendor/tzcode/dist/2026f)
In-tree prefix:	contrib/tzcode
Last imported:	2026f

To upgrade to a new version:

1. Download the tarball and signature into an empty directory and
   verify with gpg.  Extract with --no-same-owner.
2. Use the vendor-update skill (vendor/tzcode/dist, contrib/tzcode).
   Nothing is pruned; the vendor branch is the whole tarball.
3. Subtree merge into master and resolve conflicts against the local
   patches below.  FreeBSD's stable branch usually carries the same
   release and is a useful reference for conflict resolutions and for
   the mdoc versions of the manual pages.
4. Update TZVERSION in version.h.
5. Build lib/libc, usr.sbin/zic, usr.sbin/zdump and share/zoneinfo.
   lib/libc/stdtime/strftime.c is a separate copy that uses private.h
   macros and may need adjusting when they change.
6. Import tzdata of the same release (see contrib/tzdata) and add an
   UPDATING entry.

Local patches applied on top of upstream:

  - tzconfig.h, tzdir.h, version.h: generated configuration that the
    upstream Makefile would normally produce.  Bump TZVERSION in
    version.h on every import.
  - localtime.c: freebsd13_tzsetwall() symbol-versioned compat shim for
    the removed tzsetwall(3), at the end of the tzset() section.
  - localtime.c: in tzloadbody(), the ".." component check spells the
    constant as "O_RESOLVE_BENEATH != 0" to avoid clang's
    -Wconstant-logical-operand; upstream writes O_RESOLVE_BENEATH.
  - zic.c (from FreeBSD): progname is always "zic"; remove an existing
    output file before writing so hard links are broken; sign and
    size_t cleanups for -Wsign-compare.
  - zdump.c (from FreeBSD): size_t/int casts for -Wsign-compare and an
    unused-parameter fix in tzfree().
  - time2posix.3, tzfile.5, zdump.8 and zic.8 are FreeBSD's mdoc
    conversions; carry upstream text changes into them by hand (or take
    FreeBSD's updated copies).  The other manual pages are upstream's.
  - The preformatted *.txt manual pages are deleted.

Dropped with 2026f:

  - localtime.c: FreeBSD's "tzloadflags &= ~TZLOAD_FROMENV;" for a
    NULL name.  Upstream now caches the TZDEFAULT file and rereads it
    only when it changes; FreeBSD dropped the line as well.
